<p>The tower, standing about <strong>90 metres</strong> tall, was completed in <strong>1752</strong>. The final 150 steps climb around the outside of the spire in a counter-clockwise spiral. Although the ascent can be challenging, visitors are rewarded with one of Copenhagen's finest panoramic views.</p>

